{"schemaVersion":1,"articles":[{"id":"monsters.monster.goblin.statblock.worg","title":"Ворг","chapter":"23. Бестиарий","group":"Гоблины","path":"Monsters/monster/goblin/statblock/worg.md","originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.goblin.statblock/worg","originalName":"Worg","originalDescription":"|  Animal, Goblin   |         -         |      Level 1      |      Horde Mount      |         EV 3         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|  **1L**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **15**<br>Stamina |  **1**<br>Stability   | **1**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+1**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility | **-1**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **-1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🗡 **Bite (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Charge, Melee, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-----------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**                    | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 damage\n> - **12-16:** 4 damage\n> - **17+:** 5 damage\n\n> 👤 **Sprint (1 [Malice](scc.v1:mcdm.monsters.v1/rule.monster/malice))**\n>\n> | **-**       | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 Self** |  **🎯 Self** |\n>\n> **Effect:** The worg moves up to their speed.\n\n> ⭐️ **Mounted Charger**\n>\n> If a worg used as a mount charges, their rider gains an edge on melee strikes until the end of the rider's turn.\n\n> ⭐️ **Shared Craft**\n>\n> If the worg's rider has the Crafty trait, the worg also has that trait.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/goblin/statblock/worg.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"goblin","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"3","size":"1L","keywords":["Животное","Гоблин"],"role":"Скакун","organization":"Орда"},"blocks":[{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.goblin.statblock.worg"},{"type":"entity","ref":"monster.goblin.goblin-malice"}],"related":[{"id":"monsters.monster.goblin.goblin-malice","title":"Раздор гоблинов"},{"id":"monsters.monster.group.goblin","title":"Гоблины"},{"id":"monsters.rule.monster.malice","title":"Раздор"}],"originalCoverage":{"status":"complete"}}],"entities":[{"id":"monster.goblin.statblock.worg","kind":"monster","name":"Ворг","markdown":"| Животное, Гоблин |         -         |     Уровень 1      |        Орда Скакун        | Боевая ценность 3 |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-------------------------:|:----------------------:|\n| **1L**<br>Размер | **5**<br>Скорость | **15**<br>Выносливость | **1**<br>Устойчивость | **1**<br>Свободный удар |\n| **-**<br>Иммунитет | **-**<br>Передвижение | - | **-**<br>С капитаном | **-**<br>Уязвимость |\n| **+1**<br>Мощь | **+2**<br>Ловкость | **-1**<br>Разум | **0**<br>Интуиция | **-1**<br>Присутствие |\n\n> 🗡 **Укус (Знаковая способность)**\n>\n> | **Рывок, Ближний бой, Удар, Оружие** | **[Основное действие](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |--------------------------------------|-------------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Ближний бой 1** | **🎯 Одно существо или объект** |\n>\n> **Бросок силы + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 урона\n> - **12-16:** 4 урона\n> - **17+:** 5 урона\n\n> 👤 **Спринт (1 [Раздор](#/codex/monsters.rule.monster.malice))**\n>\n> | **-** | **[Манёвр](#/catalog/glossary#term-glossary.turn)** |\n> |------|-----------------------------:|\n> | **📏 На себя** | **🎯 На себя** |\n>\n> **Эффект:** Ворг перемещается на расстояние до своей Скорости.\n\n> ⭐️ **Атакующий верхом**\n>\n> Если ворг, используемый как скакун, совершает атаку с рывком, его всадник получает преимущество при ударах ближнего боя до конца своего хода.\n\n> ⭐️ **Общая хитрость**\n>\n> Если у всадника ворга есть черта «Хитрый», ворг тоже получает эту черту.\n","source":{"articleId":"monsters.monster.goblin.statblock.worg","path":"Monsters/monster/goblin/statblock/worg.md"},"originalId":"mcdm.monsters.v1/monster.goblin.statblock/worg","originalName":"Worg","originalDescription":"|  Animal, Goblin   |         -         |      Level 1      |      Horde Mount      |         EV 3         |\n|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:-----------------:|:---------------------:|:--------------------:|\n|  **1L**<br>Size   |  **5**<br>Speed   | **15**<br>Stamina |  **1**<br>Stability   | **1**<br>Free Strike |\n| **-**<br>Immunity | **-**<br>Movement |         -         | **-**<br>With Captain |  **-**<br>Weakness   |\n|  **+1**<br>Might  | **+2**<br>Agility | **-1**<br>Reason  |  **0**<br>Intuition   |  **-1**<br>Presence  |\n\n> 🗡 **Bite (Signature Ability)**\n>\n> | **Charge, Melee, Strike, Weapon** |               **[Main action](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-----------------------------------|------------------------------:|\n> | **📏 Melee 1**                    | **🎯 One creature or object** |\n>\n> **Power Roll + 2:**\n>\n> - **≤11:** 3 damage\n> - **12-16:** 4 damage\n> - **17+:** 5 damage\n\n> 👤 **Sprint (1 [Malice](scc.v1:mcdm.monsters.v1/rule.monster/malice))**\n>\n> | **-**       | **[Maneuver](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.combat/turn)** |\n> |-------------|-------------:|\n> | **📏 Self** |  **🎯 Self** |\n>\n> **Effect:** The worg moves up to their speed.\n\n> ⭐️ **Mounted Charger**\n>\n> If a worg used as a mount charges, their rider gains an edge on melee strikes until the end of the rider's turn.\n\n> ⭐️ **Shared Craft**\n>\n> If the worg's rider has the Crafty trait, the worg also has that trait.","director":{"section":"monsters","sourcePath":"monster/goblin/statblock/worg.json","sourceRevision":"bdb12093b1d07bf8674453796eac907a09dd7dd3","groupSlug":"goblin","recordType":"statblock","level":1,"ev":"3","size":"1L","keywords":["Животное","Гоблин"],"role":"Скакун","organization":"